    "连接后，Mivu 将自动开启投屏服务。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "连接后，Mivu 将自动开启投屏服务。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "連線後，Mivu 會自動啟用投放服務。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu starts the casting service automatically when connected."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu lance automatiquement le service de diffusion une fois connecté."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu startet den Übertragungsdienst nach der Verbindung automatisch."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu inicia automáticamente el servicio de transmisión al conectarse."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "O Mivu inicia o serviço de transmissão automaticamente após a conexão."}}}},
